---
---
<section class="container mx-auto px-5 mb-20 fade-in-section">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
    <!-- Education -->
    <div class="h-full glass-panel p-8 rounded-[30px] hover:bg-white transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-black">
        Education
      </h3>
      <div class="py-4">
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-2 font-medium">
          2016 – 2020
        </p>
        <h5 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-black">
          Bachelor of Technology, Computer Engineering
        </h5>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">
          Thapar Institute of Engineering & Technology, Patiala
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-500">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-green mt-0.5">→</span> Finalist, Smart India Hackathon 2018 — Project Haazri (automated attendance system)</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-green mt-0.5">→</span> Ranked nationally in leadership communication, Toastmasters International</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Professional Experience -->
    <div class="h-full glass-panel text-black p-8 rounded-[30px] hover:bg-white transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-black">
        Professional Experience
      </h3>
      <div class="py-4 space-y-6">
        <div>
            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-1 font-medium text-sm tracking-wide uppercase">2023 – Present</p>
            <h5 class="text-xl font-bold mb-1 text-black leading-tight">Deloitte Consulting USI</h5>
            <p class="text-gray-900 font-semibold mb-2 text-sm">Consultant – Strategy & Digital Transformation</p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Leads AI and automation strategy across client engagements. Owned end-to-end delivery for a Fortune 500 US retailer — 99.9% error reduction, 180+ hours/month saved, 80% fewer production failures.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-6">
            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-1 font-medium text-sm tracking-wide uppercase">2020 – 2023</p>
            <h5 class="text-xl font-bold mb-1 text-black leading-tight">Deloitte Consulting USI</h5>
            <p class="text-gray-900 font-semibold mb-2 text-sm">Analyst – Business Operations & Technology</p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Designed 50+ automation scripts achieving 90% error reduction and 10x time savings. Built automated reporting systems saving 4+ FTE hours/day.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-6">
            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-1 font-medium text-sm tracking-wide uppercase">2019 – 2020</p>
            <h5 class="text-xl font-bold mb-1 text-black leading-tight">Deloitte USI / EXL Services</h5>
            <p class="text-gray-900 font-semibold mb-2 text-sm">Early Professional Experience</p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              ERP transformation delivery and security risk analysis across healthcare and enterprise clients.
            </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-2">
          <button onclick="window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('open-resume-modal'))" class="text-green font-medium hover:underline cursor-pointer text-sm flex items-center gap-1">
              View detailed resume →
          </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Beyond Work -->
    <div class="h-full glass-panel p-8 rounded-[30px] hover:bg-white transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-black">
        Beyond Work
      </h3>
      <div class="py-4 space-y-6">
        <div>
          <h5 class="text-xl font-bold mb-1 text-black">
            Golf
          </h5>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Long-horizon discipline, precision decision-making, and performance under pressure — the same skills that matter in consulting.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h5 class="text-xl font-bold mb-1 text-black">
            Aviation & Flight Simulation
          </h5>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Complex real-time judgment in high-stakes, resource-constrained environments. A useful mental model for incident response.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h5 class="text-xl font-bold mb-1 text-black">
            Astronomy & Applied Physics
          </h5>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Systems-level thinking and first-principles problem decomposition — the foundation of good hypothesis structuring.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h5 class="text-xl font-bold mb-1 text-black">
            International Travel
          </h5>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Exposure to diverse business environments and cross-cultural collaboration across markets.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
